{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":67732,\"title\":\"Woodsmith Shop\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith Shop is designed to help you get the most out of your woodworking shop with helpful tips and techniques. Whether viewers are just starting out or have been woodworking for years, they'll find something new in every episode.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/05opC9ixu4Q/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2007,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":19,\"totalEpisodes\":221,\"createdBy\":[\"Don Peschke\"],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-10-27\",\"cast\":[],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"05opC9ixu4Q\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"yE_dUduhGM8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"aDQvWCsyr0c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":97655,\"title\":\"Classic Woodworking\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/goGYVomZXjqTJDLyRjLQ5TtxTEd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43529411764705883,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":61779,\"title\":\"Framework\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bd9kcH7xIdEH9q7SnD0bO2D8kBC.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4227848101265823,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2351,\"title\":\"TransGeneration\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cckeDldsr3JCFTp5hmyNRs5eLVX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4206896551724138,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":327624,\"title\":\"The Reclaimers: Made in Suffolk\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nJAAREOpLJtULyDAPf5ngWd8y58.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42000000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217695,\"title\":\"The Woodland Workshop\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAJbnzDN6zemQ9fxLX26MRkiJvs.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4076923076923077,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2009-09-26\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Easy to Build Shop Storage Cabinet\",\"overview\":\"The editors of Woodsmith magazine show how to build an inexpensive wall-mounted shop storage cabinet. Pegboard and smooth-sliding doors allow you to maximize your storage capacity in a minimal amount of space, and simple construction techniques make it a snap to build.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-26\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Make Beautiful Bowls with Your Router\",\"overview\":\"Bowls made with a router? See the tips, tricks, and techniques for turning a few pieces of scrap wood into beautiful bowls. No big, expensive tools are needed to make the chips fly - just a hand-held router and a special bit.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Router Table Upgrades & Add-ons\",\"overview\":\"Learn all the basics of a router table: from making a laminated top to getting a perfect-fitting insert plate. You'll learn step-by-step how to make a rock-solid router table top. Plus, the Woodsmith editors give their top picks for accessories and add-ons that will make any router table work harder.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-10\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Build Timeless Tables in a Weekend\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith editors share three quick and easy techniques for making heirloom tables. A never-fail corner joint that simply bolts together. Two ways to put a top together without having to worry about glue and clamps. And a way to add turned legs without using a lathe.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Table Saw Secrets: Box Joints\",\"overview\":\"Master this classic joinery technique. We fire up the table saw to show you the step-by-step techniques to building perfect box joint boxes -- from making your own thin stock to cutting flawless-fitting joints on the table saw.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-24\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Doors: From Ordinary to Extraordinary\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith editors explore three different ways to make cabinet doors that really stand out. Learn how to create a unique wood lattice door, use veneer to perk up a plain panel, and make doors sparkle by adding glass.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-31\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Routing Dead-on Dovetails\",\"overview\":\"The dovetail is a hallmark woodworking joint -- strong and beautiful. The Woodsmith editors show how to make heirloom-quality dovetailed drawers with just a router and an inexpensive jig. Then see special tips and tricks for getting a flawless fit.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-07\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Make Perfect Plywood Projects\",\"overview\":\"Discover the secrets of working with plywood -- from buying the right type to getting splinter-free cuts. The editors of Woodsmith will show you how to get top-notch results when it comes to building projects out of plywood.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-14\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Easy Cabinet Construction\",\"overview\":\"Looks can be deceiving. Editors from Woodsmith magazine show you how to put together a beautiful cabinet that's quick and easy to build. Plus, you'll see how to turn economically priced materials into rich-looking projects.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-21\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Top Tips for Perfect Layouts\",\"overview\":\"Accurate measurements and layouts are the secrets to getting a flawless fit. The Woodsmith editors share their favorite tips, tools, and techniques for perfect layouts.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-28\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Portable Precision Miter Saw Station\",\"overview\":\"Save time and money -- build your own miter saw station. The Woodsmith editors will show you how to turn inexpensive materials into portable workstation that will make any miter saw safer and more accurate to use.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Razor Sharp in Record Time\",\"overview\":\"Sharp tools make woodworking easier and safer. The editors from Woodsmith magazine share their favorite ways for getting razor sharp tool in record time.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Quick Tips & Great Gear\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith editors share some of their favorite shop tips and techniques. Plus, see some great new gear that makes woodworking easier, safer, and more accurate.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-19\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2007-10-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}